      "updated": 1750693369521,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "发送后即忘：消息被发送到 Kafka，而无需验证 Kafka 代理是否成功接收消息。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "发送后即忘：消息被发送到 Kafka，而无需验证 Kafka 代理是否成功接收消息。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "eqoPfx2n9tgv9K54KOAkh",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 920,
      "y": 344,
      "width": 714.15966796875,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a7",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1678409139,
      "version": 87,
      "versionNonce": 270227123,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1750693369521,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "同步：消息被发送，返回的 future 对象会调用其 get() 方法来检查 Kafka 代理\n是否成功接收消息。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "同步：消息被发送，返回的 future 对象会调用其 get() 方法来检查 Kafka 代理\n是否成功接收消息。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "yeLdtNSDL96o0wOsFIz1n",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 920,
      "y": 408.5,
      "width": 750.8997802734375,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a8",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 275835923,
      "version": 122,
      "versionNonce": 2055473235,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1750693369521,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "异步：消息被发送，并指定了一个回调函数，当从 Kafka 代理接收到响应时会被\n调用。在这种方法中，生产者不会等待从 Kafka 接收响应，而是继续发送其他消息。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "异步：消息被发送，并指定了一个回调函数，当从 Kafka 代理接收到响应时会被\n调用。在这种方法中，生产者不会等待从 Kafka 接收响应，而是继续发送其他消息。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
